      "value": "@{5b4eb6697a870c3a5c2b0ca5|full_name}:128 bools or 16 floats(0.0 - 1.0) or 16 ints(which is byte(0-255) in fact). Idk why they called it \"int\". If you want to mix up your clothes, you can have maximum only 16 different combinations of clothes at one time.",
